	'k1821ae1c' => 'Kohaku Brasserie opened in 2014 at 14 Arcade Row in the Old Exchange Quarter of Lowmarket. Founded by Inès Marchetti and Tomasz Lindqvist, the brasserie was conceived as a continuous city dining room running from lunch to the late sitting.',
