	'k25defee2' => '#kitchen',
	'k2769240a' => 'We believe hospitality is best sustained when a dining room never feels hurried or shut. Inès Marchetti and Tomasz Lindqvist founded Kohaku in 2014 to give Lowmarket a dependable table from midday until midnight. Whether you arrive for an unhurried lunch, an afternoon meeting over small plates, or a late supper at the counter, the room remains steady, generous, and attentive to every guest.',
