	'k30a36407' => 'All day.',
	'k325a9ca0' => 'Service sittings and schedule',
	'k33bce3cd' => 'Between midday service and evening dinner, Kohaku offers a rare quiet haven in the Old Exchange Quarter. Tables are spaced for privacy, allowing guests to work, read, or hold informal conversations without feeling rushed. Enjoy freshly brewed coffee alongside our daily afternoon plate while the dining room rests in calm natural light.',
