	'k369da4f9' => 'quiet hours',
	'k37ba8399' => 'Our ground-floor dining room, bar area, and kitchen counter are completely step-free and fully accessible from the Arcade Row street entrance. Spacious spacing between our 64 main dining room seats ensures comfortable navigation for wheelchair users and guests with prams or mobility aids. An accessible, step-free restroom is located immediately adjacent to the main dining room on the ground level. If you require special seating arrangements or assistance upon arrival, please let our team know when booking.',
	'k3823fe8d' => 'A single service day at Kohaku Brasserie unfolds across four continuous chapters from morning to midnight. The room adapts naturally as the daylight recedes, altering light, music, and table settings to suit each hour.',
