	'k51c1aef9' => 'counter added',
	'k520f770f' => 'the book',
	'k52849cc3' => 'Reserve a table at Kohaku Brasserie for lunch, dinner, or our late sitting. We welcome reservations up to 60 days in advance, while welcoming walk-in guests for afternoon plates and drinks.',
	'k529a39ed' => 'Is the dining room accessible for visitors with reduced mobility?',
	'k52a2e75e' => 'The quiet hours (14:30–18:00)',
	'k52cb3ca4' => 'Notes from the Brasserie',
	'k5437b7b4' => 'Yes, all 8 bar seats are held exclusively for walk-in guests throughout our opening hours. You do not need a reservation to take a seat at the bar, whether visiting for an espresso during the quiet hours from 14:30 to 18:00, an afternoon plate for €16, or a glass of wine after dinner. If the bar stools happen to be full upon your arrival, front of house co-founder Inès Marchetti and our team will gladly make you comfortable while a stool frees up.',
	'k54a61da1' => 'Midday and quiet hours menus',
	'k55634244' => '(why one room)',
	'k57a7617e' => '(about the letter)',
	'k57af5342' => 'Designed for intimate private gatherings, the Lantern Room comfortably seats 14 guests around a central timber table, or accommodates up to 20 guests for standing evening receptions. Groups dining in the room enjoy our specially crafted group set menu priced at €62 per guest. This multi-course feast showcases the finest seasonal dishes from Tomasz Lindqvist’s kitchen, served family-style down the center of the table. A minimum spend applies depending on the chosen day and sitting, with full service provided by our dedicated private room staff.',
	'k582c41e5' => 'Private Room &amp; Groups',
	'k58a8f02e' => 'When Inès Marchetti and head chef Tomasz Lindqvist opened Kohaku Brasserie in 2014, their ambition was to establish an unhurried, enduring dining room for Lowmarket. Situated at 14 Arcade Row in the Old Exchange Quarter, the room began with 64 seats arranged along wide windows and dark wood paneling. In 2019, the partners expanded the dining experience by introducing 8 counter seats directly overlooking the kitchen pass. Today, the room continues to operate under the same founding commitment to hospitality, offering a warm and steady sanctuary that carries guests seamlessly through every hour of the service day.',
	'k58da7919' => '(Lunch)',
	'k5a0c95d4' => 'One room,<br>lunch to last orders.',
	'k5aaacec1' => 'Menus &amp; Prices',
