	'k7359bccd' => 'the late sitting',
	'k735c8e41' => '(the service day)',
	'k73a42b5e' => 'Each Monday letter previews next week\'s afternoon plates served during the quiet hours from 14:30 to 18:00 for €16, curated by Tomasz Lindqvist and Kenji Albrecht-Mori. You will also discover the musical selections chosen by Daniel Okafor for the late sitting between 22:00 and midnight, along with notes on newly uncorked wines by the glass starting from €7 selected by Lucía Ferreira. It offers an authentic window into our craft, helping you plan your next visit.',
	'k74a70d73' => 'To subscribe, simply enter your email address into the form below. When you submit your request, your email client will prepare a direct subscription note addressed to bookings@kohaku-brasserie.example. We handle your contact details with care and confidentiality, never sharing them with external services. Every issue includes a simple, immediate option to unsubscribe, or you can email Hana Novak at any time to remove your address from our mailing list.',
