	'k8019c860' => '(one way to book)',
	'k80559ed3' => 'Dinner service runs from 18:00 to 22:00, offering à la carte mains from €24 including roast cod with brown butter, slow-cooked pork neck, and ember-roasted winter squash. At the 8 counter seats directly fronting the kitchen pass, Tomasz Lindqvist serves the six-course counter menu for €78, presenting an immersive sequence of market-driven courses. Later in the evening, from 22:00 until midnight, our three-course late-sitting menu is priced at €52, with comforting savory plates and desserts served until kitchen last orders at 23:15.',
