	'k83beec0d' => '(three chapters)',
	'k8506b0a3' => 'Booking a table is simple and structured across four clear steps. Step one: choose your desired sitting and party size. Step two: submit your reservation request using our booking form or by direct email. Step three: Hana Novak reviews your request and sends confirmation by email within 4 hours during opening times. Step four: arrive on time for your sitting; your table is held for 15 minutes before being released. Reservations are accepted up to 60 days ahead.',
