	'k8f06ab9a' => '18 October',
	'k8f514439' => 'All bookings for parties of 7 or more are hosted in the Lantern Room rather than the main dining hall. Hana Novak coordinates all private bookings and event inquiries, which can be reserved up to 60 days in advance. To arrange a date, please send an email request to bookings@kohaku-brasserie.example detailing your desired date, preferred sitting, and expected party size. Hana will confirm availability and discuss minimum spend and custom beverage selections within 4 hours during opening times.',
	'k914199d8' => 'Our kitchen team takes food allergies and intolerances seriously. Detailed allergen records are kept at the pass, and Amara Osei and the brigade adapt dishes to accommodate dietary needs when notified in advance. For wine pairings, sommelier Lucía Ferreira curates a versatile cellar with wines by the glass starting from €7. Each glass is chosen to harmonize with the seasoning of our seasonal dishes, allowing guests to explore distinctive regional pours whether dining at the counter, enjoying lunch, or having a late-night plate.',
	'k91588900' => 'Late-sitting menu, three courses',
	'k92e49f9c' => 'Co-founder, head chef',
