	'k944bf522' => '4 · Your table is held for 15 minutes',
	'k96c24342' => 'Daniel Okafor',
	'k96e7dd52' => 'At 14 Arcade Row, our dining room does not close between lunch and dinner. We open at 11:30 each morning and keep the doors unlocked until midnight, offering a continuous welcome in the Old Exchange Quarter.',
	'k984aa482' => 'The room rests.',
	'k986f6960' => 'The service day begins at 11:30 as morning light filters through the tall windows onto fresh white linen. Lunch caters to business colleagues, solitary readers, and neighborhood gatherings looking for a structured midday meal. Guests select between our two-course lunch for €28 or three-course lunch for €34, served with prompt efficiency from the kitchen pass. Bread arrives warm at the table, water is poured without hesitation, and the room hums with conversational energy until orders wrap at 14:30, leaving the floor ready for the quieter hours of the afternoon.',
