	'ka2c2646a' => 'What will you find inside each letter?',
	'ka3a7ab18' => 'Reservations are available up to sixty days ahead for lunch, dinner, the late sitting, and the counter pass. We hold tables for fifteen minutes. Parties of seven or more are hosted in the Lantern Room.',
	'ka554775f' => 'As midday clears, the brasserie settles into its quietest hours. The room remains open for coffee, warm tea, and our afternoon plate with no reservation required for tables of four or fewer. Soft daylight slants across wide wooden tables, welcoming solitary readers, unhurried conversations, and productive afternoon work away from the busy streets outside.',
	'ka56117da' => 'How to reach us by tram or bicycle',
	'kaa5a4caf' => 'Sous chef',
	'kaba61c1e' => 'The four-step reservation process',
	'kac40c19e' => 'The founding story from 2014 to today',
	'kad5acdfa' => 'dinner',
