	'kbbb3e3ab' => 'Wine &amp; Bar',
	'kbbe8aa36' => 'Front of house and dining room leadership',
	'kbc0962a0' => '(eight seats, no booking)',
	'kbd492b50' => 'At 18:00, crisp linen returns to the tables and tungsten lamps illuminate the room as dinner service begins. Guests order à la carte mains from €24 or experience the six-course counter menu for €78. From 22:00 until midnight, the brasserie transitions into the late sitting. Head waiter Daniel Okafor oversees the floor as candles are lit, the soundtrack turns mellow, and guests enjoy our three-course late-sitting menu for €52. Kitchen last orders are taken at 23:15, allowing the evening to wind down gently before closing at 00:00.',
