	'kc0455e04' => '(The floor)',
	'kc26b3969' => 'Our 8 bar seats provide an informal yet refined way to experience the brasserie without needing a reservation. Sommelier Lucía Ferreira curates a cellar focused on balanced, expressive bottles from independent European producers, pouring wines by the glass starting from €7. Guests are welcome to pull up a stool for an early aperitif, taste through seasonal glass pours during the afternoon, or enjoy a glass paired with dessert after an evening across the quarter. The bar offers the full warmth of our hospitality in an effortless setting.',
